th><path d="M-460 -285C-460 -285 -392 120 232 247C696 374 764 779 764 779" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.98" stroke-opacity="0.32" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-465 -291C-465 -291 -397 114 237 241C701 368 769 773 769 773" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.01" stroke-opacity="0.335" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-470 -297C-470 -297 -402 108 242 235C706 362 774 767 774 767" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.04" stroke-opacity="0.35000000000000003" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-475 -303C-475 -303 -407 102 247 229C711 356 779 761 779 761" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.0699999999999998" stroke-opacity="0.365" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-480 -309C-480 -309 -412 96 252 223C716 350 784 755 784 755" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-opacity="0.38" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-485 -315C-485 -315 -417 90 257 217C721 344 789 749 789 749" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.13" stroke-opacity="0.395" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-490 -321C-490 -321 -422 84 262 211C726 338 794 743 794 743" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.16" stroke-opacity="0.41" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-495 -327C-495 -327 -427 78 267 205C731 332 799 737 799 737" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.19" stroke-opacity="0.425" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-500 -333C-500 -333 -432 72 272 199C736 326 804 731 804 731" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.22" stroke-opacity="0.44" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-505 -339C-505 -339 -437 66 277 193C741 320 809 725 809 725" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-opacity="0.455" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-510 -345C-510 -345 -442 60 282 187C746 314 814 719 814 719" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.28" stroke-opacity="0.47000000000000003" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-515 -351C-515 -351 -447 54 287 181C751 308 819 713 819 713" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.31" stroke-opacity="0.485" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-520 -357C-520 -357 -452 48 292 175C756 302 824 707 824 707" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.3399999999999999" stroke-opacity="0.5" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-525 -363C-525 -363 -457 42 297 169C761 296 829 701 829 701" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.37" stroke-opacity="0.515" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-530 -369C-530 -369 -462 36 302 163C766 290 834 695 834 695" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-opacity="0.5299999999999999" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-535 -375C-535 -375 -467 30 307 157C771 284 839 689 839 689" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.43" stroke-opacity="0.5449999999999999" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-540 -381C-540 -381 -472 24 312 151C776 278 844 683 844 683" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.46" stroke-opacity="0.5599999999999999" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-545 -387C-545 -387 -477 18 317 145C781 272 849 677 849 677" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.49" stroke-opacity="0.575" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-550 -393C-550 -393 -482 12 322 139C786 266 854 671 854 671" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.52" stroke-opacity="0.59" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path><path d="M-555 -399C-555 -399 -487 6 327 133C791 260 859 665 859 665" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-opacity="0.605" opacity="0.6" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0.3px 1px"></path></svg></div><div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl"><div class="mb-20"><h2 class="text-white font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-16 max-w-3xl">One API Key. Every Aviation Data Point You Need — From Logos to Routes, Cities, and Live Flight Data.</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16"><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-2xl mb-4">Logo Infrastructure</p><p class="text-white/50 text-lg leading-relaxed">Airline logos, airport logos, and aircraft liveries — automatically updated, perfectly formatted, served via global CDN in SVG, PNG, and JPG.</p></div><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-2xl mb-4">Aviation Data API</p><p class="text-white/50 text-lg leading-relaxed">Airlines, airports, cities, countries, routes, and aircraft types from a single endpoint. Filter by IATA or ICAO code, enrich your UI with structured data.</p></div><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-2xl mb-4">Maps &amp; Visualizations</p><p class="text-white/50 text-lg leading-relaxed">Generate great-circle route maps, airport network charts, and range maps on the fly. Embed as SVG or export as PNG for social and print.</p></div><div><p class="text-white font-bold text-2xl mb-4">Carbon Emissions API</p><p class="text-white/50 text-lg leading-relaxed">ICAO CEC v13.1 CO₂ per passenger for all four cabin classes, EU ETS offset price, and route map — in one POST call. GHG Protocol Scope 3 compliant.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-background"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl"><div class="mb-16 max-w-2xl"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Built for Developers</p><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-foreground leading-tight mb-4">Everything You Need to Build Aviation Products — Logos, Data, and Maps</h2><p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">One API key unlocks airline logos, airport logos, aircraft liveries, flight routes, city and country data, and dynamic route maps. Stop stitching together multiple providers — logostream is your single aviation data layer.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw w-5 h-5 text-primary"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg></div><p class="text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="font-semibold">Auto-Updated Logo Library<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->When an airline rebrands or merges, our daily pipeline pushes the update live instantly. Zero maintenance, zero broken images — across 1,100+ airline and 600+ airport logos.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers w-5 h-5 text-primary"><path d="m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z"></path><path d="m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65"></path><path d="m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65"></path></svg></div><p class="text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="font-semibold">Routes, Stats &amp; Network Data<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Query 38,000+ flight routes by airport or airline. Pull pre-aggregated stats per airport or carrier — destinations count, fleet breakdown, hub airlines, countries served — all in a single request.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-moon w-5 h-5 text-primary"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="font-semibold">Smart Dark Mode Adaptation<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Every logo includes high-contrast white variants tuned for dark backgrounds. No manual CSS filters or editing required — just append ?variant=white to any request.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-5 h-5 text-primary"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="font-semibold">Cities, Countries &amp; Flags<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Rich city profiles with population, timezone, and popularity score. 252 countries with flag images, currency, phone codes, and regional data — all from one endpoint.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-code-xml w-5 h-5 text-primary"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"></path><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"></path></svg></div><p class="text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="font-semibold">Dead-Simple Integration<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Predictable REST URLs based on IATA or ICAO codes. One GET request, one perfect response. Works with any language or framework — no SDK required.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package w-5 h-5 text-primary"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path><path d="m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7"></path><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path></svg></div><p class="text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed"><span class="font-semibold">Air Waybill Lookup for Cargo<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Pass an AWB number or 3-digit prefix — get the airline logo instantly. Built for cargo tracking dashboards, freight forwarding platforms, and supply chain tools. No ICAO/IATA mapping needed on your side.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-background"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-foreground mb-10 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="space-y-6"><div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">What is the Airline Logo API?</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">The Airline Logo API provides high-resolution airline logos (SVG &amp; PNG) for 1,100+ carriers, accessible via IATA or ICAO code. It is designed for travel apps, booking platforms, and flight search UIs that need reliable, always-up-to-date airline branding assets delivered via global CDN.</p></div><div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">How do I access airline logos via IATA or ICAO code?</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Send a GET request to https://airline.logostream.dev/api/v1/airline-logo?iata=LH (or ?icao=DLH) with your API key in the Authorization header. The response is a PNG or SVG logo served from the CDN in under 100ms globally.</p></div><div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Is there a free tier available?</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Yes. The free tier includes 20,000 requests per month covering Airline Logos, Airlines Data, Cities, Routes, and Countries APIs — no credit card required. Paid plans start at $40/month and add Airport Logos, Aircraft Liveries, Route Maps, and higher request limits.</p></div><div class="border border-border rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Which file formats and logo variants are supported?</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Logos are available in SVG and PNG. Variants include: default (icon), logo, logo-transparent, logo-white, logo-bg-white, icon-transparent, tail, and tail-3D. All formats are retina-ready and optimised for both light and dark mode interfaces.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[hsl(var(--hero-background))] text-[hsl(var(--hero-foreground))] py-24"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center space-y-6 max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Ready to integrate?</h2><p class="text-white/60 text-xl">Start for free — no credit card required.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap"><button class="bg-white text-[hsl(var(--hero-background))] font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">Get started <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button><button class="border border-white/30 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">View pricing</button></div></div></section><footer class="bg-white" role="contentinfo"><section class="bg-white border-t border-gray-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 pt-8"><div class="flex justify-center"><img alt="Collection of popular company logos including Apple, Microsoft, Tesla, Google, and other major brands available through logostream API" class="max-w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" src="https://qkyxmtrnsndaujcyxzfg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/landingpage-images/logo-airlines-footer.png"></div></div></section><section class="bg-primary text-white py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="mb-8"><a href="https://airline.logostream.dev/" class="flex items-center brightness-0 invert"><img src="https://qkyxmtrnsndaujcyxzfg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/landingpage-images/logostream-airlines-logo.svg" alt="logostream Logo" class="h-8 w-auto cursor-pointer"></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8"><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-4">Legal</h3><nav class="flex flex-col gap-3"><a class="text-sm text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200" href="/terms">Terms</a><a 